WEBVTT

00:18:28.842 --> 00:18:32.743
But all of us are needed here.

00:18:33.744 --> 00:18:37.629
Just imagine all the suffering
we could alleviate

00:18:37.653 --> 00:18:41.587
if we dared to face this issue together.

00:18:42.880 --> 00:18:44.038
Thank you.

00:18:44.062 --> 00:18:48.329
(Applause)